   &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;tr class=&#34;contributed&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;15:45 - 16:00&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;Automatic Interpretation of Visual Concepts&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;Felix Meissen&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;    &lt;tr class=&#34;contributed&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;16:00 - 17:00&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;Poster session&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;        &lt;td&gt;In-person&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;width: 100%; font-size: smaller; text-align: center; margin-top: 18px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;em&gt;All times according to UCT-3.&lt;/em&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;poster-session&#34;&gt;Poster Session&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;All accepted papers will be presented as a poster at the workshop. All posters&#xA;can be put up in the morning and can remain up during the whole day (i.e.,&#xA;all posters are presented during both poster sessions).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
